The guide covers only what is on trunk and on the mail branch's
Justfile.  Work still only on the list is left out: archiving, the
committed tag and just committed, and just process-email.  It can
grow as each lands.

doc/mail-workflow.md predates this setup.  It names a claude/mail
bookmark, a mail/ maildir and saved searches that the tags no longer
produce.  I left it alone so this patch stays one change.  Retiring
it, or pointing it here, could follow if you want that.

